  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economy recovery and establishment of early warning system in flooded municipalities of Doboj region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specific objectives of the project are:To support 5 targeted municipalities of Doboj region in process of analysing, drafting, adoption and implementation of adequate early warning system as its tool for responding and recovering from floods and other types of natural disasters; and To support the most flood-affected families (80) in 5 targeted municipalities to re-engage and further develop its agriculture production.</narrative>
  </description>
